  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EATI SWE.Instit.coop - Consultant Festival</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EATI Sv.institution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska teaterinstitutioners delatgande i internationella barn- och ungdomsteaterfestivalen i Etiopien, arrangerad av EATI, &#xd6;stafrikanska Teaterinstitutet, oktober, 2000. Syftet med deltagandet &#xe4;r att rekognisera institutionella samarbetsm&#xf6;jligheter mellan Sverige och &#xd6;stafrika med b&#xe4;ring p&#xe5; barn och demokratiteater och n&#xe4;tverksbygge</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish participation in the international children&apos;s and youth theatre festival, organised by EATI, to be held in Ethiopia, 2000. The purpose with Swedish precense is to investigate the potential for institutional cooperation between Sweden and east African, focusing on children&apos;s and pro-democracy theatre and networking.</narrative>
  </description>
